# Complex Web Application Strategy

## Product Vision for Scale
- **Current State**: Monolithic limitations
- **Target State**: Distributed, independently scalable services
- **User Impact**: Sub-100ms response times, 99.99% uptime, seamless experiences at 10M+ concurrent users

## Microservices Product Decomposition

### Service Boundaries (Domain-Driven Design)
| Service | Bounded Context | Owner Team | SLA | Scale Target |
|---------|----------------|------------|-----|--------------|
| User Service | Authentication, profiles, sessions | Identity | 99.99% | 50M users |
| Content Service | Creation, storage, retrieval | Content | 99.9% | 1B objects |
| Search Service | Indexing, querying, ranking | Search | 99.95% | 10K qps |
| Notification Service | Real-time alerts, push, email | Engagement | 99.5% | 100M daily |
| Analytics Service | Event tracking, reporting | Data | 99% | 1TB/day |

