- **Product Requirement**: Single entry point for all clients
- **Rate Limiting**: Tiered by user plan (Free: 100 req/hr, Pro: 10K req/hr, Enterprise: unlimited)
- **Authentication**: JWT with refresh tokens, OAuth2 for third-party
- **Versioning**: URL-based (/v1/, /v2/), support N-1 versions
