## Content Adaptation
- [ ] Date formats: MM/DD/YYYY (US) vs DD/MM/YYYY (EU) vs YYYY/MM/DD (Asia)
- [ ] Time formats: 12-hour (US) vs 24-hour (EU)
- [ ] Number formats: 1,000.50 (US) vs 1.000,50 (EU)
- [ ] Currency: Display local currency with correct symbol placement
- [ ] Measurement units: Imperial (US) vs Metric (rest of world)
- [ ] Address formats: Vary significantly by country
- [ ] Phone number formats: Country-specific validation

## Functional Adaptation
- [ ] Payment methods: Alipay/WeChat Pay (China), iDEAL (Netherlands), Boleto (Brazil)
- [ ] Shipping providers: Local carriers preferred in each region
- [ ] Legal compliance: GDPR (EU), CCPA (California), LGPD (Brazil)
- [ ] Tax calculations: VAT (EU), GST (India, Australia, Canada), Sales Tax (US)

