### HIPAA Requirements Checklist
- [ ] **Access Control**: Unique user IDs, automatic logoff, encryption
- [ ] **Audit Controls**: Log all PHI access, tamper-proof logs
- [ ] **Integrity Controls**: Validate data hasn't been altered
- [ ] **Transmission Security**: TLS 1.2+, VPN for remote access
